      "intro": "If your loved one's household income is at or below 200% of the federal poverty level, they may qualify for free home weatherization services that can significantly reduce monthly utility bills. The program provides a professional energy audit followed by improvements like insulation installation, air leak sealing, duct work repairs, and heating/cooling system tune-ups or replacements.\n\nBecause Texas administers this program through approximately 30 regional agencies rather than one state office, you'll need to contact the specific subrecipient that serves your loved one's county. Priority goes to households with elderly residents, people with disabilities, or families with children under 6, though waitlists are common due to funding limits.",
