          "For disability-based eligibility, HHSC may conduct its own disability determination using medical records, work history, and education history if the person is not already receiving a qualifying disability benefit such as SSI or Social Security Disability Insurance.",
          "Some applicants must apply through the Social Security Administration for SSI first; others apply directly to HHSC. A caseworker will tell you which path fits your parent's situation.",
