            "description": "Call 855-937-2372 and ask specifically for Community Attendant Services through Community Care Services Eligibility (CCSE) intake. This routes your call to the local office that handles CAS, not the general Medicaid line. Have your parent's name, address, and a brief description of their care needs ready."
