            "description": "If your parent does not already have financial verification on file with HHSC, they will need to submit Form H1200-EZ (Application for Assistance: Aged and Disabled) or Form H1200 (Application for Assistance: Your Texas Benefits). The financial review is handled through the Medicaid for the Elderly and People with Disabilities (MEPD) process and checks income against the $2,982/month limit and assets against the $2,000 cap. Gather income and asset documents before this step."
